          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "സൂര്യാസ്തമയം (sūryāstamayaṁ) is a Malayalam compound built from Sanskrit sūrya, \"the sun\", and astamaya, \"setting of the sun\" (Monier-Williams)."
